  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. red dirt, no shade for 400 clicks and nobody's caught you in three laps. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Saltbush\n02:11 Throttle Line\n04:27 Night Kickdown\n06:39 Heatwave\n08:51 Bulldust\n11:03 Long Paddock Loop\n13:14 Momentum\n15:29 Broken Burnout\n17:42 Dry Creek Line\n19:53 Sector Three\n22:05 Outstation\n24:16 Dust\n26:30 Gibber\n28:44 Spinifex Circuit\n30:58 Night Corrugation\n33:11 Nitro\n35:21 Cold Traction\n37:35 Overdrive\n39:45 Gearshift Loop\n41:58 Red Dirt Rush\n44:10 Road Train\n46:20 Mirage\n48:29 Hidden Ironstone\n50:42 Hyper Sunburn\n52:53 Deep Claypan\n55:04 Turbo\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
